{"page":81,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"인터뷰","words":[{"text":"인터뷰","x":154,"y":278,"width":124,"height":47}]},{"text":"레너드 클라인록","words":[{"text":"레너드","x":150,"y":422,"width":174,"height":58},{"text":"클라인록","x":338,"y":420,"width":239,"height":68}]},{"text":"레너드 클라인록은 캘리포니아, 로스앤젤레스대학교 전산학과 교수다. 1969년 UCLA에서","words":[{"text":"레너드","x":145,"y":555,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"클라인록은","x":243,"y":553,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"캘리포니아,","x":401,"y":553,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"로스앤젤레스대학교","x":573,"y":551,"width":261,"height":34},{"text":"전산학과","x":849,"y":553,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"교수다.","x":978,"y":554,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"1969년","x":1099,"y":552,"width":101,"height":32},{"text":"UCLA에서","x":1218,"y":552,"width":144,"height":32}]},{"text":"그의 컴퓨터는 인터넷 최초의 노드가 되었다. 1961 년 그가 창안한 패킷 교환 원리는 인터넷의","words":[{"text":"그의","x":143,"y":606,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"컴퓨터는","x":212,"y":606,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"인터넷","x":335,"y":604,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"최초의","x":431,"y":604,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"노드가","x":526,"y":604,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"되었다.","x":624,"y":603,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"1961","x":739,"y":605,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"년","x":815,"y":604,"width":26,"height":32},{"text":"그가","x":852,"y":605,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"창안한","x":923,"y":605,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"패킷","x":1020,"y":605,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"교환","x":1087,"y":604,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"원리는","x":1157,"y":603,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"인터넷의","x":1254,"y":603,"width":111,"height":31}]},{"text":"기반 기술이 되었다. 그는 뉴욕의 CCNY에서 전자공학 학사학위를 받았고 MIT에서 전자공","words":[{"text":"기반","x":145,"y":657,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"기술이","x":214,"y":657,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"되었다.","x":310,"y":656,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"그는","x":421,"y":656,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"뉴욕의","x":490,"y":655,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"CCNY에서","x":591,"y":655,"width":151,"height":32},{"text":"전자공학","x":756,"y":655,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"학사학위를","x":885,"y":656,"width":143,"height":32},{"text":"받았고","x":1042,"y":656,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"MIT에서","x":1158,"y":654,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"전자공","x":1283,"y":654,"width":84,"height":31}]},{"text":"학 분야의 박사학위를 받았다.","words":[{"text":"학","x":145,"y":709,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"분야의","x":181,"y":708,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"박사학위를","x":277,"y":707,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"받았다.","x":429,"y":706,"width":94,"height":32}]},{"text":"네트워킹/인터넷 기술을 전공한 계기는 무엇인가?","words":[{"text":"네트워킹/인터넷","x":143,"y":1224,"width":220,"height":33},{"text":"기술을","x":377,"y":1224,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"전공한","x":476,"y":1224,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"계기는","x":578,"y":1224,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"무엇인가?","x":679,"y":1225,"width":146,"height":32}]},{"text":"1959년 MIT 박사과정 당시 주위의 동기들 대부분이 코딩 이론과 정보이론 분야에서 연구하는","words":[{"text":"1959년","x":143,"y":1286,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"MIT","x":252,"y":1290,"width":64,"height":25},{"text":"박사과정","x":330,"y":1286,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"당시","x":465,"y":1285,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"주위의","x":539,"y":1286,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"동기들","x":646,"y":1286,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"대부분이","x":756,"y":1286,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"코딩","x":897,"y":1286,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"이론과","x":976,"y":1285,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"정보이론","x":1087,"y":1285,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"분야에서","x":1225,"y":1283,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"연구하는","x":1365,"y":1283,"width":120,"height":35}]},{"text":"것을 알게 되었다. MIT에는 이 분야의 창시자고 대부분의 중요 문제를 해결한 클라우드 섀년이","words":[{"text":"것을","x":142,"y":1340,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"알게","x":213,"y":1340,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"되었다.","x":285,"y":1340,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"MIT에는","x":397,"y":1340,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":537,"y":1341,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"분야의","x":577,"y":1341,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"창시자고","x":684,"y":1341,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"대부분의","x":826,"y":1341,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"중요","x":965,"y":1342,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"문제를","x":1042,"y":1340,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"해결한","x":1152,"y":1340,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"클라우드","x":1256,"y":1340,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"섀년이","x":1392,"y":1340,"width":89,"height":35}]},{"text":"라는 대가가 있었다. 남기진 문제의 연구들은 어렵지만 덜 중요한 것이었다. 그래서 아무도 생각","words":[{"text":"라는","x":140,"y":1395,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"대가가","x":212,"y":1395,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"있었다.","x":315,"y":1396,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"남기진","x":426,"y":1395,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"문제의","x":529,"y":1396,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"연구들은","x":637,"y":1396,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"어렵지만","x":775,"y":1396,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"덜","x":915,"y":1396,"width":28,"height":33},{"text":"중요한","x":957,"y":1395,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"것이었다.","x":1068,"y":1395,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"그래서","x":1213,"y":1396,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"아무도","x":1318,"y":1397,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"생각","x":1422,"y":1397,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"하지 못한 새로운 분야를 시작하기로 결정했다. MIT에는 많은 컴퓨터가 있었고 이들이 서로 통","words":[{"text":"하지","x":139,"y":1450,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"못한","x":210,"y":1450,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"새로운","x":283,"y":1450,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"분야를","x":386,"y":1451,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"시작하기로","x":491,"y":1451,"width":156,"height":35},{"text":"결정했다.","x":660,"y":1451,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"MIT에는","x":807,"y":1451,"width":133,"height":33},{"text":"많은","x":952,"y":1451,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"컴퓨터가","x":1030,"y":1450,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"있었고","x":1170,"y":1452,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"이들이","x":1275,"y":1453,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"서로","x":1380,"y":1452,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"통","x":1453,"y":1454,"width":32,"height":33}]},{"text":"신할 필요가 있음을 확신했지만, 그 당시에는 그렇게 할 수 있는 효율적인 방법이 없었다. 그래","words":[{"text":"신할","x":139,"y":1504,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"필요가","x":213,"y":1505,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"있음을","x":317,"y":1505,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"확신했지만,","x":420,"y":1506,"width":162,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":596,"y":1511,"width":32,"height":23},{"text":"당시에는","x":641,"y":1506,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"그렇게","x":780,"y":1506,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"할","x":890,"y":1506,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":935,"y":1506,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":983,"y":1506,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"효율적인","x":1058,"y":1506,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"방법이","x":1200,"y":1507,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"없었다.","x":1308,"y":1508,"width":99,"height":33},{"text":"그래","x":1422,"y":1508,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"서 효율적인 데이터 네트워크를 수행하는 기술을 개발하기로 결정했다.","words":[{"text":"서","x":139,"y":1560,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"효율적인","x":179,"y":1560,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"데이터","x":312,"y":1560,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크를","x":415,"y":1560,"width":154,"height":34},{"text":"수행하는","x":580,"y":1561,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"기술을","x":718,"y":1561,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"개발하기로","x":825,"y":1560,"width":159,"height":35},{"text":"결정했다.","x":997,"y":1560,"width":134,"height":35}]},{"text":"컴퓨터 산업에서 당신의 첫 직업은 무엇인가? 그리고 어떤 결과를 가져왔는가?","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터","x":138,"y":1683,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"산업에서","x":237,"y":1683,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"당신의","x":368,"y":1683,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"첫","x":468,"y":1683,"width":28,"height":32},{"text":"직업은","x":509,"y":1683,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"무엇인가?","x":609,"y":1683,"width":143,"height":32},{"text":"그리고","x":763,"y":1684,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"어떤","x":869,"y":1683,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"결과를","x":943,"y":1684,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"가져왔는가?","x":1047,"